{title: 462 - Blessed Assurance, Jesus is Mine!}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #462 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 462}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab7/Gb]Blessed assurance, [Db]Jesus [Fm]is mine!
[Fm/Ab]O, what [Ab]a foretaste of glory [Ab7/Gb]divine!
[Ab]Heir [Ab7]of [Fm]salvation, purchase [Ab7]of [Ebm/Gb]God,
[Ab7/Gb]Born of His [Db/F]Spirit, washed in His blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Db]This is [Gb/Db]my story, [Db]this is my song,
[Db]praising [Ebm]my Savior [Ab]all the day long;
[Db]this is my story, [Ab]this [Ab7]is my [Ebm/Gb]song,
[Ebm]praising my Savior [Db/F]all the day long.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab7/Gb]Perfect [Fm]submission, [Db]perfect [Fm]delight,
[Fm/Ab]visions [Ab]of rapture now burst on [Ab7/Gb]my [Fm]sight;
[Ab]angels [Fm]descending bring [Ab7]from above
[Ab7/Gb]echoes of [Db/F]mercy, whispers of love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab7/Gb]Perfect [Fm]submission, [Db]all [Fm]is at rest;
[Fm/Ab]I in [Ab]my Savior am happy [Ab7/Gb]and [Fm]blest,
[Ab]watching [Fm]and waiting, looking [Ab7]above,
[Ab7/Gb]filled with his [Db/F]goodness, lost in his love.
{end_of_verse}
